    "40 | Search hashes straight to one bucket and checks only its chain: **O(1)** on average, **O(n)** if every key collides. | - | Hash table, 5 buckets, 5 keys, load factor 1.00. Bucket 0: Ann. Bucket 2: Ben. Bucket 3: Sid, Jim, Kat. | ⏸ chapter-end",
