    "84 | **Jim** is replaced by a **tombstone**, not emptied, so searches for keys further on keep going. | p-remove-mark | Hash table, 7 buckets, 2 keys, load factor 0.29. Bucket 1: Sid. Bucket 2: tombstone. Bucket 3: Kat.",
    "85 | Add up the letter codes of **Kat**: h("Kat") = 288. | hash-fn | Hash table, 7 buckets, 2 keys, load factor 0.29. Bucket 1: Sid. Bucket 2: tombstone. Bucket 3: Kat. h("Kat") = 288.",
    "86 | 288 mod 7 = 1, so **Kat** belongs in bucket 1. | hash-index | Hash table, 7 buckets, 2 keys, load factor 0.29. Bucket 1: Sid. Bucket 2: tombstone. Bucket 3: Kat. 288 mod 7 = 1.",
    "87 | Bucket 1 holds **Sid**, not **Kat**. Probe on to 2. | p-get-probe | Hash table, 7 buckets, 2 keys, load factor 0.29. Bucket 1: Sid. Bucket 2: tombstone. Bucket 3: Kat.",
