    "91 | 288 mod 7 = 1, so **Leo** belongs in bucket 1. | hash-index | Hash table, 7 buckets, 2 keys, load factor 0.29. Bucket 1: Sid. Bucket 2: tombstone. Bucket 3: Kat. 288 mod 7 = 1.",
    "92 | Bucket 1 holds **Sid**: a **collision**. Probe the next bucket, 2. | p-put-probe | Hash table, 7 buckets, 2 keys, load factor 0.29. Bucket 1: Sid. Bucket 2: tombstone. Bucket 3: Kat. Bucket 1: collision.",
    "93 | Bucket 2 has a **tombstone**. Remember it, but check on: **Leo** may be further along. | p-put-tombstone | Hash table, 7 buckets, 2 keys, load factor 0.29. Bucket 1: Sid. Bucket 2: tombstone. Bucket 3: Kat.",
