    "39 | Call **fib(1)**: a **base case**, so it returns 1 straight away. | fib-base | Call stack, top first: fib(1), base case: 1; fib(2), fib(1) + fib(0); fib(4), 2 + fib(2); fib(5), fib(4) + fib(3). Calls made: 9.",
