    "49 | Call **fib(0)**: a **base case**, so it returns 0 straight away. | fib-base | Call stack, top first: fib(0), base case: 0; fib(2), 1 + fib(0); fib(3), fib(2) + fib(1); fib(5), 3 + fib(3). Calls made: 14.",
