    "60 | Call **fib(4)** = fib(3) + fib(2). It calls **fib(3)** first and waits. | memo-left | Call stack, top first: fib(4), fib(3) + fib(2); fib(5), fib(4) + fib(3). Calls made: 2. Memo: empty.",
    "61 | Call **fib(3)** = fib(2) + fib(1). It calls **fib(2)** first and waits. | memo-left | Call stack, top first: fib(3), fib(2) + fib(1); fib(4), fib(3) + fib(2); fib(5), fib(4) + fib(3). Calls made: 3. Memo: empty.",
