    "83 | Call **fact(0)**. With no base case, it always calls **fact(-1)** next, and waits. | broken-call | Call stack, top first: fact(0), 0 × fact(-1); fact(1), 1 × fact(0); fact(2), 2 × fact(1); fact(3), 3 × fact(2). Calls made: 4.",
