    "38 | **5a** isn’t smaller than **3**. Keep looking. | compare | Array of 4 items, 4 slots: 1, 3, 5, 5. min at index 1. j at index 3. i at index 1. 1 of 4 sorted.",
    "39 | The smallest, **3**, is already at index 1. No swap needed: it’s in place. | place | Array of 4 items, 4 slots: 1, 3, 5, 5. min at index 1. i at index 1. 2 of 4 sorted.",
    "40 | Find the smallest from index 2 to 3. **min** starts on **5b**, at index 2. | scan | Array of 4 items, 4 slots: 1, 3, 5, 5. min at index 2. i at index 2. 2 of 4 sorted.",
    "41 | **5a** isn’t smaller than **5b**. Keep looking. | compare | Array of 4 items, 4 slots: 1, 3, 5, 5. min at index 2. j at index 3. i at index 2. 2 of 4 sorted.",
    "42 | The smallest, **5b**, is already at index 2. No swap needed: it’s in place. | place | Array of 4 items, 4 slots: 1, 3, 5, 5. min at index 2. i at index 2. 3 of 4 sorted.",
    "43 | Sorted! Comparisons: 6. Swaps: 1. | - | Array of 4 items, 4 slots: 1, 3, 5, 5. 4 of 4 sorted.",
