  "steps": [
    "0 | A **sliding window** is a run of neighbouring items that moves along the array. | - | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 1, 5, 1, 3, 2, 8, 1. Window size 3.",
    "1 | Which 3 neighbours have the biggest sum? Adding up every window from scratch is **O(n·k)**. | - | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 1, 5, 1, 3, 2, 8, 1. Window size 3.",
    "2 | A window of **3**: add up the first 3 items. Sum: **8**. | sum-start | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 1, 5, 1, 3, 2, 8, 1. left at index 0. right at index 2. Window size 3. Sum 8. Best 8.",
    "3 | Slide right: add **1**, take away **2**. Sum: **7**, without adding the rest again. | sum-slide | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 1, 5, 1, 3, 2, 8, 1. left at index 1. right at index 3. Window size 3. Sum 7. Best 8.",
    "4 | Slide right: add **3**, take away **1**. Sum: **9**, the best so far. | sum-slide | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 1, 5, 1, 3, 2, 8, 1. left at index 2. right at index 4. Window size 3. Sum 9. Best 9.",
    "5 | Slide right: add **2**, take away **5**. Sum: **6**, without adding the rest again. | sum-slide | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 1, 5, 1, 3, 2, 8, 1. left at index 3. right at index 5. Window size 3. Sum 6. Best 9.",
    "6 | Slide right: add **8**, take away **1**. Sum: **13**, the best so far. | sum-slide | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 1, 5, 1, 3, 2, 8, 1. left at index 4. right at index 6. Window size 3. Sum 13. Best 13.",
    "7 | Slide right: add **1**, take away **3**. Sum: **11**, without adding the rest again. | sum-slide | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 1, 5, 1, 3, 2, 8, 1. left at index 5. right at index 7. Window size 3. Sum 11. Best 13.",
    "8 | The biggest sum of 3 in a row is **13**, at index 4 to 6. One pass: **O(n)**. | sum-done | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 1, 5, 1, 3, 2, 8, 1. left at index 4. right at index 6. Found 3 at index 4. Window size 3. Best 13.",
    "9 | Each slide added one item and took one away: two reads, whatever k is. That’s **O(n)**. | - | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 1, 5, 1, 3, 2, 8, 1. Window size 3. | ⏸ chapter-end",
    "10 | A window can change size too. Find the longest run of letters with **no repeats**. | - | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: a, b, c, a, b, c, b, b. Window size 3.",
    "11 | Find the longest run with no repeats. The window starts empty, at index 0. | unique-start | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: a, b, c, a, b, c, b, b. Window size 3.",
    "12 | Add **a**: no repeat, so the window grows to 1, the longest so far. | unique-grow | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: a, b, c, a, b, c, b, b. left at index 0. right at index 0. Window size 3. Window length 1. Best 1.",
    "13 | Add **b**: no repeat, so the window grows to 2, the longest so far. | unique-grow | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: a, b, c, a, b, c, b, b. left at index 0. right at index 1. Window size 3. Window length 2. Best 2.",
    "14 | Add **c**: no repeat, so the window grows to 3, the longest so far. | unique-grow | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: a, b, c, a, b, c, b, b. left at index 0. right at index 2. Window size 3. Window length 3. Best 3.",
    "15 | **a** is already in the window. Shrink it from the left until it isn’t. | unique-shrink | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: a, b, c, a, b, c, b, b. left at index 0. right at index 2. Window size 3. Window length 3. Best 3.",
    "16 | Drop **a** from the left. The window is now 2 long. | unique-shrink | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: a, b, c, a, b, c, b, b. left at index 1. right at index 2. Window size 3. Window length 2. Best 3.",
    "17 | Add **a**: it’s not in the window yet, so the window grows to 3. | unique-grow | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: a, b, c, a, b, c, b, b. left at index 1. right at index 3. Window size 3. Window length 3. Best 3.",
    "18 | **b** is already in the window. Shrink it from the left until it isn’t. | unique-shrink | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: a, b, c, a, b, c, b, b. left at index 1. right at index 3. Window size 3. Window length 3. Best 3.",
    "19 | Drop **b** from the left. The window is now 2 long. | unique-shrink | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: a, b, c, a, b, c, b, b. left at index 2. right at index 3. Window size 3. Window length 2. Best 3.",
    "20 | Add **b**: it’s not in the window yet, so the window grows to 3. | unique-grow | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: a, b, c, a, b, c, b, b. left at index 2. right at index 4. Window size 3. Window length 3. Best 3.",
    "21 | **c** is already in the window. Shrink it from the left until it isn’t. | unique-shrink | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: a, b, c, a, b, c, b, b. left at index 2. right at index 4. Window size 3. Window length 3. Best 3.",
    "22 | Drop **c** from the left. The window is now 2 long. | unique-shrink | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: a, b, c, a, b, c, b, b. left at index 3. right at index 4. Window size 3. Window length 2. Best 3.",
