    "27 | Add **b**: it’s not in the window yet, so the window grows to 2. | unique-grow | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: a, b, c, a, b, c, b, b. left at index 5. right at index 6. Window size 3. Window length 2. Best 3.",
    "28 | **b** is already in the window. Shrink it from the left until it isn’t. | unique-shrink | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: a, b, c, a, b, c, b, b. left at index 5. right at index 6. Window size 3. Window length 2. Best 3.",
    "29 | Drop **c** from the left. The window is now 1 long. | unique-shrink | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: a, b, c, a, b, c, b, b. left at index 6. right at index 6. Window size 3. Window length 1. Best 3.",
    "30 | Drop **b** from the left. For a moment, the window is empty. | unique-shrink | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: a, b, c, a, b, c, b, b. left at index 7. right at index 7. Window size 3. Window length 0. Best 3.",
    "31 | Add **b**: it’s not in the window yet, so the window grows to 1. | unique-grow | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: a, b, c, a, b, c, b, b. left at index 7. right at index 7. Window size 3. Window length 1. Best 3.",
    "32 | The longest run with no repeats has **3** items, index 0 to 2. Each item went in and out once. | unique-done | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: a, b, c, a, b, c, b, b. left at index 0. right at index 2. Found a at index 0. Window size 3. Best 3.",
