    "47 | The longest run with no repeats has **3** items, index 2 to 4. Each item went in and out once. | unique-done | Array of 6 items, 6 slots: p, w, w, k, e, w. left at index 2. right at index 4. Found w at index 2. Window size 3. Best 3.",
