    "54 | **1** ≤ **3** and leaves sooner, so it can never be the biggest again: pop it. | max-pop | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 1, 3, 2, 5, 4, 2, 6, 1. left at index 0. right at index 1. Window size 3. Deque empty.",
    "55 | Push **3** onto the back of the deque. Deque: 3. | max-push | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 1, 3, 2, 5, 4, 2, 6, 1. max at index 1. left at index 0. right at index 1. Window size 3. Deque: 3.",
