    "57 | Window 0 to 2: the biggest is at the front of the deque, **3**. | max-record | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 1, 3, 2, 5, 4, 2, 6, 1. max at index 1. left at index 0. right at index 2. Found 3 at index 1. Window size 3. Best 3. Deque: 3 2.",
    "58 | **2** ≤ **5** and leaves sooner, so it can never be the biggest again: pop it. | max-pop | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 1, 3, 2, 5, 4, 2, 6, 1. max at index 1. left at index 1. right at index 3. Window size 3. Deque: 3.",
    "59 | **3** ≤ **5** and leaves sooner, so it can never be the biggest again: pop it. | max-pop | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 1, 3, 2, 5, 4, 2, 6, 1. left at index 1. right at index 3. Window size 3. Deque empty.",
    "60 | Push **5** onto the back of the deque. Deque: 5. | max-push | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 1, 3, 2, 5, 4, 2, 6, 1. max at index 3. left at index 1. right at index 3. Window size 3. Deque: 5.",
    "61 | Window 1 to 3: the biggest is at the front of the deque, **5**. | max-record | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 1, 3, 2, 5, 4, 2, 6, 1. max at index 3. left at index 1. right at index 3. Found 5 at index 3. Window size 3. Best 5. Deque: 5.",
    "62 | Push **4** onto the back of the deque. Deque: 5 4. | max-push | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 1, 3, 2, 5, 4, 2, 6, 1. max at index 3. left at index 2. right at index 4. Window size 3. Deque: 5 4.",
    "63 | Window 2 to 4: the biggest is at the front of the deque, **5**. | max-record | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 1, 3, 2, 5, 4, 2, 6, 1. max at index 3. left at index 2. right at index 4. Found 5 at index 3. Window size 3. Best 5. Deque: 5 4.",
    "64 | Push **2** onto the back of the deque. Deque: 5 4 2. | max-push | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 1, 3, 2, 5, 4, 2, 6, 1. max at index 3. left at index 3. right at index 5. Window size 3. Deque: 5 4 2.",
    "65 | Window 3 to 5: the biggest is at the front of the deque, **5**. | max-record | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 1, 3, 2, 5, 4, 2, 6, 1. max at index 3. left at index 3. right at index 5. Found 5 at index 3. Window size 3. Best 5. Deque: 5 4 2.",
    "66 | **5** has slid out of the window, so it leaves the front of the deque. | max-expire | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 1, 3, 2, 5, 4, 2, 6, 1. max at index 4. left at index 4. right at index 6. Window size 3. Deque: 4 2.",
    "67 | **2** ≤ **6** and leaves sooner, so it can never be the biggest again: pop it. | max-pop | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 1, 3, 2, 5, 4, 2, 6, 1. max at index 4. left at index 4. right at index 6. Window size 3. Deque: 4.",
    "68 | **4** ≤ **6** and leaves sooner, so it can never be the biggest again: pop it. | max-pop | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 1, 3, 2, 5, 4, 2, 6, 1. left at index 4. right at index 6. Window size 3. Deque empty.",
    "69 | Push **6** onto the back of the deque. Deque: 6. | max-push | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 1, 3, 2, 5, 4, 2, 6, 1. max at index 6. left at index 4. right at index 6. Window size 3. Deque: 6.",
    "70 | Window 4 to 6: the biggest is at the front of the deque, **6**. | max-record | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 1, 3, 2, 5, 4, 2, 6, 1. max at index 6. left at index 4. right at index 6. Found 6 at index 6. Window size 3. Best 6. Deque: 6.",
    "71 | Push **1** onto the back of the deque. Deque: 6 1. | max-push | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 1, 3, 2, 5, 4, 2, 6, 1. max at index 6. left at index 5. right at index 7. Window size 3. Deque: 6 1.",
    "72 | Window 5 to 7: the biggest is at the front of the deque, **6**. | max-record | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 1, 3, 2, 5, 4, 2, 6, 1. max at index 6. left at index 5. right at index 7. Found 6 at index 6. Window size 3. Best 6. Deque: 6 1.",
    "73 | Window maxima: **3 5 5 5 6 6**. Each item joined and left the deque at most once: **O(n)**. | - | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 1, 3, 2, 5, 4, 2, 6, 1. Window size 3. Deque: 6 1.",
